      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and call trace, proxy creation receipt, complete Upgraded(address) log range from block 20191518 through the exploit block, pre-exploit implementation bytecode hash, pinned reproduction, and Verichains analysis. The exploit calls proxy 0x3d20601ac0ba9cae4564ddf7870825c505b69f1a, which delegates the vulnerable command to 0x51bdbfcd7656e2c25ad1bc8037f70572b7142ecc. Its only pre-exploit upgrade event is log 171 in the creation transaction and selects that implementation. The exploit receipt records an exact transfer of 188013.365080870249823427 asdCRV; Verichains reports its contemporaneous value as $73,325."
